  "projectName": "Sapiom SDK",
  "projectDescription": "A TypeScript/Node.js monorepo SDK for building, running, and operating AI agents on Sapiom — including authoring typed step graphs, calling cloud capabilities (sandboxes, models, repositories, storage, and more), and deploying via CLI, MCP, or Agent Studio.",
